\cf4 DISPGEN\cf0 	\
	Many new options added and others changed.\
	You always look at $cmfdist/com/maingen.f to see/add options.\
	maingen.f has a relatively simple structure.\
\
	With \cf4 dispgen.exe \cf0 you do not need to read in all the atomic data files. If you are only\
	interested in structure plots, or CNO, you can simply read in RVTJ, and for example, CNO. The\
